    "accessibility": {
      "short": "A person in a white dress with blue trim sits before a mirror, seen from behind, in an impressionistic painting.",
      "long": "An oil painting depicts a figure from behind and slightly to the side, seated and leaning forward toward a tall mirror on the left. The figure has light-toned hair styled up, wears a white off-the-shoulder garment with thin blue ribbons at the neckline, and a black choker. A small earring is visible on the right ear. Their right arm is raised, hand near the head. On a shelf reflected in the mirror are a clear glass jar with a pink-topped stopper and white flowers. The background is composed of expressive, blended brushstrokes in cool and warm neutrals, with no distinct walls or furniture.",
